er consumer seam is checked against the continuity invariant.\n- [ ] Deterministic artifact/disposition fixtures pass; the coordinator owns fresh-agent interrupted-invocation evaluation.\nNested spec: docs/superpowers/runs/2026-10-16-workflow-reliability/2026-10-16-finding-continuity-design.md\nDesign complete: no new abstractions; four reviewed LEAF children. Core contract independent of external ledger API; silence cannot resolve.\n",
