h-uncertainty external assumption worth a spike before deciding\n- **previouslyRejected:** `true` only for a re-surfaced prior rejection (see \"Prior report\");\n  omit otherwise\n\nState each finding you report at full strength — do not soften its wording; weighing it is\nthe judges' job.\n\nCaptured source: base 96ba44f6f5ced6166997c74aee1ba374b6c3fe0f, head 7ddd110053fb302c4f6a0bd645ddbf28c512c563. Read source with `git -C '/private/tmp/ufz-live-isolation/caller' show 7ddd110053fb302c4f6a0bd645ddbf28c512c563:<path>`; all diffs use `git -C '/private/tmp/ufz-live-isolation/caller' diff 96ba44f6f5ced6166997c74aee1ba374b6c3fe0f...7ddd110053fb302c4f6a0bd645ddbf28c512c563`.",
