+owns: Caller-owned deferred measurement and super-auto root acceptance gates.
+consumes: Recovery obligations from super-plan-ufz.4; evidence outcomes from super-plan-ufz.5; outstanding invocation findings from super-plan-ufz.8; existing super-auto final sweep and human gates.
