++      owns: Run-level failure attribution and owner retention independently of individual-task base exoneration.
++      consumes: Persisted source/fix history from super-plan-ufz.4 and source-bound evidence outcomes from super-plan-ufz.5; existing task base and run-start/sweep baseline evidence.
