++        owns: Complete source occurrence extraction contract.
++        consumes: Existing final-review/report formats and caller-supplied immutable source reference.
++    - super-plan-ufz.8.3 · Carry findings through collection resume and reports · Collect settled immutable review bundles into the committed run directory and recover interrupted collection. · deps: super-plan-ufz.8.4
