++## Execution, source identity and limits
++
++The evaluator used installed writing-skills and its testing-skills-with-subagents reference, plus the required TDD background and verification-before-completion guidance. No skill/product content was edited. Respondents were **gpt-6.1-sol / medium / fork_turns=none**, one fresh agent per arm/repetition, with at most three active concurrently. Launch order was installed/final/control for repetitions 1 through 5. No respondent was reused or sent follow-up coaching. Each received the historical bounded decision wrapper with only guidance/scenario paths substituted. They were allowed to read only their named references and case; no operational commands, source exploration, file edits, Herdr actions or cross-respondent communication were authorized.
