++    "description": "Validate ledger transport and calculate existing run counts mechanically before interpretation. Distinguish missing/unreadable/truncated/valid-empty; reconcile available Git/tracker evidence before authoritative totals, retaining supported partial results on gaps. Separate latest attempt from history, repaired from deferred/rejected and task landings from base absorption. Report actual ID discrepancies before causal guesses. Keep ordinary execution metadata out of friction-event counts. The coordinator owns fresh-agent interpretation checks; deterministic producers/consumers are tested here.\n\nSpec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-16-workflow-reliability-design.md\nFiles: skills/super-code/coordinator.js, skills/super-code/scripts/ledger-digest, skills/super-code/coordinator-workflow.md, skills/super-code/coordinator-subagents.md, skills/super-auto/SKILL.md, skills/super-auto/run-state.md, skills/super-auto/report-prompt.md, skills/upstream-feedback/SKILL.md, tests/super-code/replay-harness.mjs, tests/super-auto/test-scripts.sh\nowns: Ledger transport status, post-reconciliation deterministic counts, discrepancy reporting and execution-metadata/friction count semantics.\nconsumes: Persisted recovery/fix history from super-plan-ufz.4 and supported finding dispositions from super-plan-ufz.8.4; existing Git task-landing identities and tracker reconciliation.\n\nAcceptance:\n- [ ] An unexplained empty transport after known ledger appends is unavailable evidence, distinct from a valid-empty or fresh-missing ledger.\n- [ ] Missing/unreadable/truncated inputs yield qualified supported partial results instead of invented final totals.\n- [ ] Finish reconciliation is reflected in reported totals and actual discrepant task IDs are shown before causes are proposed (needs: super-plan-ufz.4).\n- [ ] A clean latest attempt retains earlier repaired history; deferred/rejected items are not counted as repaired (needs: super-plan-ufz.4, super-plan-ufz.8.4).\n- [ ] Base-absorption merges do not inflate task-landings, and ordinary Workflow selection metadata does not inflate friction events.\n- [ ] Deterministic producer/consumer fixtures pass; the coordinator owns representative fresh-agent report interpretation evaluation.\nblocked-by super-plan-ufz.4: consumes Durable recovery facts, compatible digest transport and resume reconciliation of those facts.\nblocked-by super-plan-ufz.8.4: consumes Immutable super-code invocation reviews, outstanding invocation-finding consumption and evidence-backed punch-list disposition.",
